# EverShop Modules Quick Reference

Essential module patterns for EverShop. For comprehensive guide, see `docs/EVERSHOP-MODULES-EXTENSIONS-WIDGETS-THEMES.md`.

---

## Module Structure

```
module_name/src/
├── api/                 # REST endpoints
│   ├── global/          # Global middleware
│   └── endpoint/
│       ├── route.json
│       └── middleware.ts
├── pages/               # SSR pages
│   ├── admin/           # Admin panel
│   ├── frontStore/      # Storefront
│   └── global/          # Global page middleware
├── services/            # Business logic
├── graphql/            
│   ├── types/           # GraphQL schemas
│   └── resolvers/       # Query/mutation resolvers
├── migration/           # Database migrations
│   └── Version_X.Y.Z.ts
└── bootstrap.ts         # Module initialization
```

⚠️ **NEVER edit core modules** in `node_modules/@evershop/` - use extensions instead.

