## API Routes

### route.json

```json
{
  "methods": ["POST"],
  "path": "/api/product/create",
  "access": "private"
}
```

### Middleware Chain

```
api/createProduct/
├── route.json
├── validateProduct.ts               # Step 1
└── [validateProduct]saveProduct.ts  # Step 2 (depends on 1)
```

Naming: `[dependency]middlewareName.ts`

### Middleware Pattern

```typescript
// ✅ 3-arg (success)
export default function middleware(
  req: Request,
  res: Response,
  next: NextFunction
): void {
  // Validation/processing
  if (error) {
    res.status(400).json({ error: 'Invalid' });
    return;
  }
  next();
}

// ✅ 4-arg (error handler)
export default function errorHandler(
  err: Error,
  req: Request,
  res: Response,
  next: NextFunction
): void {
  res.status(500).json({ error: err.message });
}
```

